### Search for decisions
POST http://localhost:8002/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "search_decisions",
    "arguments": {
      "query": "Insolvenzverfahren",
      "limit": 5
    }
  }
}

### Get decision by doknr
POST http://localhost:8002/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "get_decision_by_doknr",
    "arguments": {
      "doknr": "JURE100055033"
    }
  }
}